	linkml:description "A LinkML model of the Common Weakness Enumeration, the catalogue of software and hardware weakness types that The MITRE Corporation publishes for the CWE Program. It renders the catalogue's XML Schema with its own element names and values, so the whole catalogue validates with both unchanged." ;
